msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "Very well, Sarah."
msgstr "分かったわ、サラ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "We will draft the documents and have them signed. A pact to keep each of our houses in order."
msgstr "我々が文書を作成し、署名させましょう。両家を秩序正しく維持するための協約です。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In the dark of night, the secret agreement between their countries was struck."
msgstr "夜の闇の中、両国の間の秘密の合意が交わされた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah returned to her room, happy to have both gained a vote, as well as secured herself and Maeiv from future instability."
msgstr "サラは自室に戻り、票を得たことに加え、自分とマエイヴを将来の不安定さから守ることができたことに満足していた。"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Give her nothing"
msgstr "何も与えない"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I am not so desperate for your vote that I must beg and barter for it."
msgstr "あなたの票をそこまで必死に求めているわけじゃないから、懇願したり取引したりする必要もないわ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Maeiv"
msgid "Fine, then I will vote as I see fit, and it shall be against your position."
msgstr "分かったわ。それなら私は自分の思うように投票する。そしてそれはあなたの立場に反対するものになるわ。"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Meet with Antonio"
msgstr "Antonio と会う"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah had attempted to schedule her meeting with Duke Antonio."
msgstr "サラはアントニオ公爵との会合を予定しようと試みていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As he appeared to enjoy doing, he long avoided her before finally extending an invitation."
msgstr "彼が好んでやっていたように、彼は長い間彼女を避けていたが、ついに招待状を渡した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hesitantly, Sarah arrived at his room late that evening."
msgstr "ためらいがちに、サラはその日の夜遅く、彼の部屋に到着した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Her memories of their encounter in the garden were first on her mind."
msgstr "庭での二人の出会いの記憶が、まず彼女の心に蘇った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Aah, I am so glad you could make it."
msgstr "ああ、来てくれて本当に嬉しいよ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Of course, Duke Antonio."
msgstr "もちろんです、公爵アントニオ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I was glad to be able to have this meeting with you before the next council."
msgstr "次の評議会前にあなたと会えて、とても嬉しかったです。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Duke grinned."
msgstr "公爵はにっこりと笑った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Always so hard working."
msgstr "いつも本当に働き者ですね。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Please, take a seat."
msgstr "どうぞ、お座りください。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He gestured at the table nearby and Sarah sat down."
msgstr "彼は近くのテーブルを指さし、サラは腰を下ろした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I wanted to have this chance to speak with you privatel to again..."
msgstr "君と再び二人きりで話す機会を得たかったんだ…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah saw him move about nervously."
msgstr "サラは彼が不安げに動き回るのを見た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "To again offer my deepest apologies."
msgstr "再び、心からの謝罪を申し上げたいのです。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Ooh. For what, exactly?"
msgstr "うふん。一体何について、なの？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah knew exactly for what, but she could not deny enjoying the torture of this man."
msgstr "サラはそれが何のためなのか正確に分かっていたが、この男を苦しめることが楽しいことを否定することはできなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saw the Duke begin to sweat."
msgstr "彼女は公爵が汗をかき始めるのを見た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I...perhaps I dare not even speak of it. Best to let such vile things be forgotten."
msgstr "わ…おそらく、口に出すことさえできないのだろう。そんな卑劣なことは忘れ去るのが一番だ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Yet not so vile you did not dare first propose them?"
msgstr "それでも、それほど卑劣なものではなかったから、最初にそれを提案する勇気があったのではありませんか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saw the Duke nervously shift in his seat."
msgstr "彼女は公爵が椅子の上で神経質に身を動かすのを見た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Again...I am truly sorry. It is no defense, but I was drunk and I-"
msgstr "また…本当に申し訳ない。言い訳にはならないが、私は酔っていたし、そして—"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah threw up her hands and interrupted him."
msgstr "サラは両手を振り上げて彼の話を遮った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Please. Spare me the poor excuse."
msgstr "頼むわ。その情けない言い訳は聞きたくないの。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "What brings on this sudden act of remorse?"
msgstr "何がこの突然の後悔を引き起こしたの？"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Can a man not simply feel the guilt of his conscience?"
msgstr "男の人間は、単に良心の罪悪感を感じるだけではないのか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A man? Yes."
msgstr "男？ええ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A pig? No."
msgstr "豚だと？違うわ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saw him wince at the insult."
msgstr "彼女は彼がその侮辱に顔をしかめるのを見た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Well...perhaps I was recently made more acutely aware of your husband's reputation..."
msgstr "ええ…おそらく、私は最近になって、あなたの夫の名声をより強く意識するようになったのでしょう…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She wished the man feared her enough on her own merit, but for lack of that, she would gladly make use of her husband's reputation."
msgstr "彼女は、その男が自分自身を十分に恐れてくれればと願っていたが、それが叶わない以上、夫の名声を喜んで利用するつもりだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Ooh, pray tell."
msgstr "あら、ぜひ聞かせてちょうだい。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "One of my knights attended a tourney in Rosanna and told stories of your husband's success in the melee."
msgstr "私の騎士の一人がロザンナでの馬上槍試合に参加し、あなたの夫の戦闘での成功談を語ってくれました。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "It was true that Varga, besides his tactical skill, was also a skilled enough warrior."
msgstr "ヴァルガが戦術的な能力に加えて、十分な腕を持つ戦士であったのも事実だった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He was not the greatest swordsman that ever walked the earth, but compared to a fat blob like the Duke, he might as well be."
msgstr "彼はこれまで生きてきた中で最も優れた剣士というわけではないが、公爵のような太った塊と比べれば、そうでもなくはないだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "So you heard the stories and now you are afraid?"
msgstr "つまり、話は聞いて、今や怖くなったの？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Duke forced a smile."
msgstr "公爵は無理に笑みを浮かべた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Well...I would not put it as such, of course."
msgstr "まあ…もちろん、そのように言うつもりはないのだが。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I was simply hoping that..."
msgstr "私はただ…そう願っていただけだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Well...that our differences were put to rest."
msgstr "ええと…我々の対立が解消されたということですね。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Differences?"
msgstr "対立？"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You propositioned his wife."
msgstr "あなたは彼の妻に言い寄ったのですよ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Is a man not entitled to learn when another insults his honor? Insults the honor of his wife?"
msgstr "男というものは、他人が自分の名誉を傷つけた時、学ぶ権利がないというのか？ましてや、妻の名誉を傷つけたのなら？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saw the Duke grow nervous again."
msgstr "彼女は公爵が再び緊張するのを見た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Well...of course...but...I hoped that we might come to understand one another..."
msgstr "ええ…もちろん…しかし…我々が互いを理解できるようになることを願っていたのです…"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "And that you might be willing to understand my mistake and consider my behavior as such..."
msgstr "そして、私の過ちを理解し、私の行動をそのように考えてくれるかもしれないと…"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "As a mistake?"
msgstr "過ちとして？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Duke nodded."
msgstr "公爵は頷いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Perhaps I will consider painting your poor behavior as best I can."
msgstr "おそらく、あなたのその不適切な振る舞いを、できる限り良いものとして受け止めてみようか。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Spare you my husband's wrath."
msgstr "夫の怒りからあなたを救ってあげるわ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Duke lowered his head."
msgstr "公爵は頭を下げた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I would be forever grateful to put this matter to rest."
msgstr "この件を終わらせることで、私は永遠に感謝するだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "How grateful?"
msgstr "どれほど感謝するっていうの？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saw the understanding in his face."
msgstr "彼女は彼の顔に浮かんだ理解の表情を見て取った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Were you to be so considerate of my interests...I would of course in turn be considerate of yours..."
msgstr "もしあなたが私の利益にそれほど配慮してくださるというのであれば…もちろん、私もその見返りとしてあなたの利益を配慮するつもりです…"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Whatever vote you need from me, you will have it."
msgstr "私に必要とされる票は、何であれ、すべてお与えします。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah smiled and bowed her head."
msgstr "サラは微笑み、頭を下げた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "A true and genuine act of remorse. Something like that would make me consider looking more kindly on your failings."
msgstr "真摯で誠実な後悔の表れですね。そのようなことがあれば、あなたの過ちにももう少し寛大に見てやろうかと考えさせられるでしょう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Then let it be so!"
msgstr "では、そのようにしよう！"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I will give you my vote on this matter, and you will...pray not speak of this matter to your husband."
msgstr "この件に関してはあなたに投票しますが、どうかこのことを夫には話さないでください。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Or should it be spoken of, paint me for the fool that I was."
msgstr "あるいは、このことを公にし、かつての愚か者として私を晒すべきだろうか。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Thank you, Duke Antonio."
msgstr "ありがとうございます、公爵アントニオ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I think we have finally come to an understanding."
msgstr "これでようやく理解し合えたと思うわ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She had gotten what she came for, and paid little of a price for it."
msgstr "彼女は目的を達成し、ほとんど代償を払うこともなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Please, let us discuss the upcoming matter of political rights."
msgstr "では、これから始まる政治的権利の問題について話し合いましょう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I am interested to learn of your position."
msgstr "あなたの立場について詳しく伺いたいのですが。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "My position is simple. I want to make certain that the rights of the nobility are properly enshrined."
msgstr "私の立場は単純です。平民の権利が正しく保障されるようにしたいのです。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "My position is simple. I want to make certain that the rights of the commoners are properly enshrined."
msgstr "私の立場は単純です。平民の権利が正しく保障されるようにしたいのです。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Duke smiled and nodded."
msgstr "公爵は微笑んで頷いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "A clear and logical position."
msgstr "明確で論理的な立場だ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "But I fear I cannot bring myself to agree."
msgstr "しかし、同意する気にはなれないようだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Why?"
msgstr "なぜ？"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Because you have not yet earned my vote."
msgstr "なぜなら、君はまだ私の支持を得ていないからだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Earned?"
msgstr "「支持を得た？」"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Yes. I think last time we had such a good understanding of one another..."
msgstr "ええ。前回、我々は互いをよく理解できたと思うのだが…"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I would like us to continue understanding one another."
msgstr "我々が互いを理解し続けることを望むのだが。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt his eyes roaming her body."
msgstr "サラは彼の視線が自分の体をなめるように巡っているのを感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She still struggled to believe that she had revealed herself to him like that...endured his vile nature."
msgstr "彼女はまだ、自分が彼にそのように身をさらし、彼の卑劣な性質に耐えたという事実を信じきれずにいた…"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If you are suggesting-"
msgstr "もしあなたが提案しているのなら—"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I am."
msgstr "はっきり言わせてもらうが。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Let me be very plain."
msgstr "はっきり言っておくが。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I am not moved by pleas to a better nature. I have none."
msgstr "私はより良い本性への訴えには心を動かされない。私にはそんなものはないのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I would burn half my country if I could make a decent enough coin off it."
msgstr "もしそれで十分な利益が得られるなら、俺は国の半分を焼き尽くすだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "These proposals, I frankly don't care much for one way or the other."
msgstr "これらの提案については、正直なところ、どちらの方向でも大して気にしていない。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "But you do."
msgstr "だが、君は違う。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Yes, you're such a good person. A good ruler. You wish nothing but the best for your nation."
msgstr "ええ、あなたは本当に良い人だ。優れた統治者だ。自国のためには最善のことしか望まないのだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "So tell me..."
msgstr "では、教えてくれ…"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Is your precious honor worth sacrificing getting what you want? What you think is best for your people?"
msgstr "お前が大切にしているその名誉は、望むものを手に入れるため、そして国民のためだと信じている選択のために犠牲にする価値があるというのか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He leaned back, his fat belly protruding still."
msgstr "彼は後ろにのけぞった。太った腹がまだ突き出たままだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Give me what I want, it will be little more than a memory in a few days time."
msgstr "望むものをよこせ。数日もすれば、それは記憶にも残らないほどの些事になるだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "But these proposals will stand centuries."
msgstr "しかし、これらの提案は数世紀にわたって存続するだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah had hoped to come here and discuss. Bargain. Anything to gain the votes she needed."
msgstr "サラはここに来て話し合い、取引をすることで、必要な票を得られると期待していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She had not imagined it would come down to this."
msgstr "彼女は、事態がここまで来るとは思ってもいなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She sighed, heavily."
msgstr "彼女は重いため息をついた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "What could she do, though? This man was unmoved by anything else."
msgstr "だが、彼女に何ができるというのか？この男は他の何物にも心を動かされないのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And how could she protest now? When she had already suffered this before?"
msgstr "今さらどうやって抗議できるというのか？以前にもすでにこれを経験したというのに。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "What would one more humiliation be? Was it not worth the price for what she would gain?"
msgstr "さらなる屈辱が一つ増えたところで何だというのか？ 得られるもののために、その代償を払う価値がないとでも？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah stood up."
msgstr "公爵が口を開く前に、彼女は自ら服を脱ぎ始めた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Before the Duke could even speak, she began to undress herself."
msgstr "公爵が口を開くよりも先に、彼女は服を脱ぎ始めた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Her clothes came off quickly."
msgstr "彼女の服は素早く脱がされた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Better this be over faster, she thought to herself as she threw the last of her clothes off."
msgstr "早く終わってほしいものね、と彼女は最後の服を脱ぎ捨てながら心の中で思った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Standing naked in the room, she saw the growing hunger in his eyes."
msgstr "部屋に裸で立っていた彼女は、彼の目に増していく飢えを見て取った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His eyes wildly roamed across her body."
msgstr "彼の目は彼女の体を荒々しく見渡した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Definitely."
msgstr "もちろんだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as he undid his pants and began to stroke himself."
msgstr "サラは、彼がズボンを下ろし、自分を撫で始めるのを見ていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His cock, large as it was, swiftly grew bigger still."
msgstr "彼のペニスは、すでに大きかったにもかかわらず、さらに素早く大きくなっていった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "The famous Sarah Rose..."
msgstr "有名なサラ・ローズ…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He groaned as he salivated over her."
msgstr "彼は彼女を見てよだれを垂らしながら、うめき声を漏らした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt her face burn."
msgstr "サラは顔が熱くなるのを感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Come on, get over here."
msgstr "ほら、こっちに来なさい。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah faced him."
msgstr "サラは彼と対峙した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "You heard me."
msgstr "聞こえたはずだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That...that wasn't the deal!"
msgstr "それ…それは約束通りじゃなかった！"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "The deal?"
msgstr "取引だと？"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "We have something in writing?"
msgstr "書面によるものがあるのか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah stuttered as she tried to find the words."
msgstr "サラは言葉を探そうと、どもりながら言った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...we..."
msgstr "私…私たち…"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "What? Did you think you were going to get by with the same show as before?"
msgstr "何だと？ 前回と同じ手口で済まそうと思っていたのか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "I've seen every bit of you plenty now."
msgstr "もうお前のことなど、隅々まで見飽きたわ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "If you want my vote, you're going to have to put some work in."
msgstr "もし私の票が欲しいなら、もっと努力しないとね。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He waved his erection from side to side."
msgstr "彼は勃起したものを左右に振った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You want me to..."
msgstr "私に…そうしてほしいと？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt her voice trail."
msgstr "サラは声が途切れるのを感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Come on now. Better get too it before I change my mind about those votes."
msgstr "おいおい、さっさとやらないと、あの投票の件で考えを変えちまうぞ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "In that case, I guess you stripped for me for free."
msgstr "それなら、君は僕のために無料で服を脱いだということだな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He laughed at his own comment, his voice echoing off the walls."
msgstr "彼は自分のコメントに笑い、その声が壁に響き渡った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She had accepted that this humiliation was what she would take...for her nation..."
msgstr "彼女は、この屈辱が自らの国のためならば受け入れなければならないと悟っていた…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Slowly, she edged towards the Duke."
msgstr "ゆっくりと、彼女は公爵の方へ近づいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Dropping to her knees in front of the Duke, Sarah looked at his cock."
msgstr "公爵の前にひざまずき、サラは彼のペニスを眺めた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "This close, it seemed massive."
msgstr "この距離で見るとな、とてつもなく大きく見えた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Duke Antonio"
msgid "Get to work. If you make me finish, you'll get all the votes you want."
msgstr "さっさと始めろ。もし俺に最後までやらせるようなことがあれば、お前が欲しい票は全部手に入るだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He laughed again."
msgstr "彼はまた笑った。"

