msgstr "サラは自分の裸の体を見た。尻は真っ赤に燃え、顔は夫の精液で覆われていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Burn that image of yourself into your mind."
msgstr "その自分の姿を脳裏に焼き付けろ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Because if you keep resisting me, that is what will happen to you, over and over again."
msgstr "もし抵抗し続けるなら、お前にはこうなるんだ。何度も、何度も。"

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Every night if I have to, I'll plaster that pretty face of yours with my cum."
msgstr "必要とあらば、毎晩お前のその綺麗な顔を俺の精液で塗りたくってやる。"

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Every night, I'll beat your ass to red you won't be able to sit."
msgstr "毎晩、お前のケツを赤くなるまで殴りつけて、座れなくしてやる。"

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "And if you think that is the limit of my imagination, I suggest you don't test me."
msgstr "もしこれが俺の想像力の限界だと思っているなら、試すなと忠告しておく。"

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Understood?"
msgstr "分かったか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah meekly nodded."
msgstr "サラは従順に頷いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "Then go clean up. We need to sleep."
msgstr "じゃあ、行って体を清めてこい。我々は眠らなければならない。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, feeling oddly grateful that he had decided to end his torture here."
msgstr "サラは頷いた。彼がここで自分の拷問を終わらせる決断をしたことに、奇妙な感謝を感じながら。"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Resist Marion"
msgstr "マリオンに抵抗する"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah gathered all the strength she could."
msgstr "サラはありったけの力を振り絞った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I said no!"
msgstr "私は断ったのよ！"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I'm your wife, but I am not your puppet!"
msgstr "私はあなたの妻だけど、あなたの操り人形じゃないの！"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I have a mind of my own and when I see fit, I'll speak-"
msgstr "私には自分の意志があるの。そして、そう思うなら、私は口を利くわ—"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "This crack rang out louder than another before."
msgstr "このひび割れの音は、これまでのどの音よりも大きく響いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "AAAAAAHHH!!!"
msgstr "ああああああっ！！！"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Marion brought his belt down."
msgstr "マリオンはベルトを振り下ろした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Again. Again. Again."
msgstr "また。また。また。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Before, he had whipped her, taken pauses, held back."
msgstr "以前は、彼は彼女を鞭打っても間を置き、自制していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Now, he flogged her ass without mercy."
msgstr "今や、彼は彼女の尻を容赦なく鞭打った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Again and again, the leather of his belt dug into her flesh."
msgstr "何度も何度も、彼のベルトの革が彼女の肉に食い込んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah screamed, begged, cried."
msgstr "サラは叫び、懇願し、泣いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "None of it seemed to matter to Marion."
msgstr "そのどれもがマリオンには意味がないようだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The only thing he wanted to hear from her were the words of her submission."
msgstr "彼が彼女から聞きたいのは、ただ彼女の服従の言葉だけだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "So easy, she thought. Surrender..."
msgstr "簡単だわ、と彼女は思った。降伏するだけ……"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But some deep part of herself resisted him. Refused to yield."
msgstr "しかし、彼女自身の心の奥底にある何かが彼に抵抗していた。屈することを拒んでいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "AAAAH!!!"
msgstr "あああ！！！"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah cried out again as he belt struck her again."
msgstr "サラは再び叫んだ。彼のベルトが再び彼女を打ったのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Marion"
msgid "You fucking bitch!"
msgstr "このクソ女！"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His rage was in his words, his body, his assault."
msgstr "彼の怒りは言葉に、体にも、そしてその襲撃にも表れていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In the end, her cries, pleading and tears, all faded."
msgstr "結局、彼女の叫び声も、懇願も、涙も、すべて消え去った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "What was left was the husk of her body, and the embers of her resistance."
msgstr "残されたのは、彼女の身体の抜け殻と、抵抗の残り火だけだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "When Marion realized she barely reacted to his beating, he finally stopped."
msgstr "マリオンが彼の殴打にほとんど反応しないことに気づくと、彼はついに手を止めた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Before, Sarah had felt the pain of each blow, but by now, her ass burned with a constant and permanent pain."
msgstr "以前は、サラは一つ一つの打撃の痛みを感じていたが、今では彼女の尻が絶え間なく続く恒久的な痛みで燃えていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Marion picked her up and threw her onto the bed."
msgstr "マリオンは彼女を掴み上げ、ベッドの上に投げつけた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Angrily, he left, slamming the door behind him without speaking a word."
msgstr "怒りに満ちた彼は、一言も発さずにドアを乱暴に閉めて去っていった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah laid on her bed...hours passing before she dared to move again."
msgstr "サラはベッドに横たわっていた……何時間も経ってから、ようやく再び動けるようになった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The pain in her ass finally faded. Not by much, but enough that she dared to move."
msgstr "彼女の尻の痛みはついに和らいだ。それほど大きくは変わらなかったが、それでも動かせるほどには。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah gathered a cloth, dunked it in the water that she kept next to her bed, and placed the cold rag on her ass."
msgstr "サラは布を一枚取り、ベッドの横に置いてある水に浸し、その冷たい湿布を尻に当てた。彼女がこれほどまでに打ちのめされたことは…おそらく今まで一度もなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She had not been beaten like this in...perhaps ever."
msgstr "彼女はこれまで、これほどまでに打ちのめされたことはなかった――おそらく、これまで一度も。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah remained still, tending only to her pain."
msgstr "サラは身じろぎもせず、ただ痛みを和らげることに集中していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But deep within, she felt not pain, but pride."
msgstr "しかし心の奥深くでは、彼女は痛みではなく、誇りを感じていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Pride that she had resisted."
msgstr "自分が抵抗できたことへの誇り。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Despite all of his assaults on her...she was still standing."
msgstr "彼の度重なる襲撃にもかかわらず…彼女はなおも立っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah woke the next day."
msgstr "サラは翌日目を覚ました。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Except for herself, the bed was empty."
msgstr "ベッドは彼女自身を除いて空っぽだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Light was already creeping through the curtains."
msgstr "すでに光がカーテンの隙間から差し込んでいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "What time was it?"
msgstr "何時だろうか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She wondered where Marion could be. Likely busy, as he always appeared to be."
msgstr "彼女はマリオンがどこにいるのか不思議に思った。おそらく忙しいのだろう、彼はいつもそう見えたから。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah couldn't blame him."
msgstr "サラは彼を責めることはできなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "There was a lot of work to be done."
msgstr "やるべき仕事は山積みだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "They had defeated the Tribes, but victory was not so clean."
msgstr "彼らは部族を打ち破ったが、勝利はそれほど潔いものではなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Endless reports had begun to make their way to the capital, petitions urging Thomas to act."
msgstr "絶え間ない報告が首都に届き始め、トマスに行動を促す嘆願書も相次いでいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "For while the Capital had managed to repel the Tribes and break their army, the Eastern Provinces had not been so fortunate."
msgstr "首都は部族を撃退し、その軍勢を打ち破ることに成功していたが、東部諸州はそれほど幸運ではなかったのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Many towns had been raided, pillaged, burned."
msgstr "多くの町が襲撃され、略奪され、焼かれていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Reports told of entire towns, sometimes even cities, ruined."
msgstr "報告によれば、町全体、時には都市までもが廃墟と化していたという。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Worse still, scouts often spoke of how few bodies they actually discovered among the ruins."
msgstr "さらに悪いことに、斥候たちは廃墟の中から見つかるとは限らない遺体の少なさについてしばしば語っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "If a city was burned, one expected countless dead."
msgstr "都市が焼かれたとなれば、数え切れないほどの死者が出るはずだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Without the bodies, there was only one other troubling truth."
msgstr "遺体がない以上、もう一つだけ厄介な真実が残されていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Many of the inhabitants of the Eastern Provinces had suffered slavery at the hands of the Tribes."
msgstr "東部諸州の住民の多くは、部族の手によって奴隷にされていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Some had been freed, after the battle outside the Capital, but many were not accounted for."
msgstr "解放された者もいたが、首都郊外での戦いの後、多くの人々の行方は依然として不明のままであった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sons. Daughters. Wives. Carried off in chains to Gods knew where."
msgstr "息子たち。娘たち。妻たち。鎖で縛られ、神のみぞ知る場所へと連れ去られた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Their farms, burned. Their cattle, killed and left to rot in the sun."
msgstr "彼らの農地は焼き払われ、家畜は殺されて太陽の下で腐敗させられた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Those who had managed to escape the Tribes, had found their homes gone."
msgstr "逃げ延びた者たちは、自分たちの家がなくなったことに気づいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "They still had their lives, but such things were cheap when one had no money, family or home."
msgstr "彼らにはまだ命があったが、金も家族も家もない者にとって、そんなものは安っぽかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Some of these men and women had been farmers for generations, reaching back beyond even their grandparents."
msgstr "これらの男女の何人かは、何世代にもわたって農家として暮らしてきたのだ。その歴史は、彼らの祖父母の世代にまで遡る。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "All the certainty of their lives had been wiped away."
msgstr "彼らの人生における確かなものすべてが、一瞬にして消し去られてしまった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The cities of Rosanna were swelling with refugees."
msgstr "ロザンナの都市は難民で溢れかえっていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And as was so often the case, those who still had something, resented and feared those who now had nothing."
msgstr "そして、よくあることだが、まだ何かを持っている人々は、今や何も持たなくなった人々を恨み、恐れていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "For in them, they saw their own worst fears reflected."
msgstr "彼らの中に、自分たちの最も恐ろしい恐怖が映し出されていたのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That they were not all so different, and that they likewise lived upon the edge between surviving and ruin."
msgstr "彼らもまたそれほど異なっておらず、同じように生き残りと破滅の狭間で生きているのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The exhaustion had forced her to sleep, but the crude shaking of a cart now roughly woke her."
msgstr "疲労で彼女は眠らざるを得なかったが、今、荷車の荒々しい揺れによって乱暴に目覚めさせられた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She might have slept, but Sarah still felt exhausted."
msgstr "彼女は眠っていたかもしれないが、サラはまだ疲労を感じていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She was lying on her stomach, she could feel her breasts press against the hard wooden floor of the cart."
msgstr "彼女はうつ伏せになっていた。胸が荷車の硬い木製の床に押し付けられるのを感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Her hands were still bound behind her back. She wore a blindfold, but it had begun to shift, allowing her to peek through with one eye."
msgstr "彼女の手はまだ背中に縛られたままだった。目隠しをされていたが、それがずれてきて、片目で外を窺うことができた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The ropes that bound her had begun to cut into her wrists."
msgstr "彼女を縛っていた縄が手首を食い込み始めていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "All across her skin she could feel the wooden surface of the cart. She realized she was still fully naked."
msgstr "彼女の肌全体に、荷車の木製の表面が感じられた。彼女は自分がまだ完全に裸であることに気づいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "An oppressive heat filled the air in the cart."
msgstr "車内は息が詰まるような熱気に満ちていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As she tried to move, Sarah felt something straining against her throat. It took her a moment to understand she was still wearing the collar."
msgstr "彼女が動こうとすると、サラは喉に何かが引っかかるのを感じた。しばらくして、彼女はまだ首輪をつけていることに気づいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The wagon suddenly stopped, causing Sarah to roll around the wooden floor."
msgstr "荷車が突然止まり、サラは木製の床の上で転がった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The door to the cart flew open. Sarah stared up and saw the officer standing in the doorway."
msgstr "荷車のドアが勢いよく開いた。サラが顔を上げると、衛兵が戸口に立っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Looking past him, Sarah saw the star-filled night sky."
msgstr "彼を通り越して、サラは星が満ちた夜空を見た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "By now, the officer had come to understand that talking didn't achieve much, and so he simply grabbed Sarah without saying anything."
msgstr "今や衛兵隊長は話しても大して効果がないと悟っており、何も言わずにサラを掴んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Still bound, he held onto her arm and guided her out of the cart."
msgstr "まだ拘束されたまま、彼は彼女の腕を掴んで荷車から連れ出した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As soon as Sarah stepped out, she felt her feet sinking into the sands of the desert. She had never felt anything like it."
msgstr "サラが外へ踏み出した途端、足元が砂漠の砂に沈んでいくのを感じた。彼女はこれまで、これほどの感触を味わったことがなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The sand felt like a warm blanket around her ankles."
msgstr "砂は彼女の足首を温かい毛布のように包み込んでいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Above them, the stars shone brighter than Sarah had ever seen before in her life."
msgstr "彼女たちの頭上では、星々がサラがこれまでの人生で見たこともないほど明るく輝いていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The officer dragged Sarah out towards a camp fire, where several other soldiers were sitting."
msgstr "将校はサラを野営地の焚き火の方へ引きずり出した。そこには他の兵士たちが何人か座っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As they noticed her coming closer, some began to howl and jeer at her."
msgstr "彼女が近づいてくるのに気づくと、何人かが彼女に向かって吠え、嘲笑し始めた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah did her best to ignore them."
msgstr "サラは彼らを無視しようと最善を尽くした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "It was hard to look dignified, fully naked and bound, Sarah realized."
msgstr "完全に裸で縛られている状態で尊厳を保つのは難しいと、サラは気づいていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The officer pulled a dagger from his belt, and for a moment, Sarah felt her heart freeze."
msgstr "衛兵隊長はベルトから短剣を抜き、サラは一瞬、心臓が凍りつくのを感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But the officer had no ill intent, and instead, slashes through the bindings on her wrists, freeing her hands."
msgstr "しかし衛兵隊長に悪意はなく、代わりに彼女の腕の束縛を切り裂き、手を解放した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah rubbed her wrists, a much needed relief from the pain of being tied up."
msgstr "サラは手首を揉んだ。縛られていたことで生じた痛みから、切実に解放されたのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The officer only looked at her confused."
msgstr "衛兵隊長はただ困惑したように彼女を見つめるだけだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked around the campfire, and saw that all the men had their eyes on every part of her. She did her best to cover herself, but the men never looked away."
msgstr "サラはキャンプファイアの周りを見回し、男たちが自分の体の隅々まで視線を注いでいることに気づいた。彼女はできる限り体を隠そうとしたが、男たちの目は決して離れなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The officer said some things at her, emoting towards a large black cast iron pot, sitting on the fire."
msgstr "衛兵隊長は彼女に向かって何かを言いながら、火の上に置かれた大きな黒い鋳鉄の鍋を指さした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah didn't understand, but the officer kept up, finally verbalizing a few broken words."
msgstr "サラは理解できなかったが、士官は説明を続け、ついにいくつかの断片的な言葉を口にした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Officer"
msgid "You...cook."
msgstr "君は…料理をするのか。"

msgctxt "speaker-name"
msgid "Officer"
msgstr "上官"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt a wave of relief coming over her. Her mind had imagined many worse things by now."
msgstr "サラは安堵の波が押し寄せるのを感じた。彼女の心は、今やもっとひどい事態を数多く想像していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Almost grateful, she nodded excessively at the officer."
msgstr "彼女はほとんど感謝しているかのように、衛兵隊長に過度に頷いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The officer showed her some cooking utensils, a dull knife, a ladel, a large wooden spoon, and a hand full of ingredients."
msgstr "衛兵隊長は彼女に調理器具をいくつか見せた。鈍いナイフ、レードル、大きな木のスプーン、そして一握りの食材だった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah had never been a great cook, but she imagined even her cooking couldn't be bad enough to justify injury, and so she committed herself to the task."
msgstr "サラはこれまで大した料理上手ではなかったが、自分の料理が怪我を正当化するほど悪くなるはずがないと想像し、その作業に没頭した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Though Sarah still had no clothes on, she found it easier to forget her shame when she was busy working."
msgstr "サラはまだ服を着ていなかったが、作業に夢中になっていると、羞恥心を忘れやすくなった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "From the corner of her eyes, she could see the men still looked at her, but by now it was more incidental than constant."
msgstr "視界の隅で、男たちがまだ自分を見ているのが分かったが、今ではそれは絶え間なく続くというよりは、単なる付随的なものになっていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah chopped up some of the vegetables, adding them into the pot."
msgstr "サラは野菜をいくつか刻み、鍋に加えた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "For a moment, she thought about using the dull knife to fight herself to freedom, but she quickly realized that the idea was absurd."
msgstr "一瞬、彼女は鈍いナイフで自分を切りつけて自由になろうかと考えたが、すぐにその考えが馬鹿げていると気づいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "There were close to twenty soldiers, each massive in size and armed with real weapons and armor."
msgstr "兵士は二十人近くおり、一人一人が巨大な体躯を持ち、本物の武器と鎧で武装していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Even in the impossible chance that she did overcome them, it would just leave her stranded in the middle of a desert."
msgstr "たとえあり得ない確率で彼らを打ち破ったとしても、彼女はただ砂漠の真ん中で取り残されるだけだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She shook her head and forgot the laughable idea."
msgstr "彼女は首を横に振って、その馬鹿げた考えを忘れた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Adding to the soup, Sarah chopped up some of the pork that was available and cooked it over a spit."
msgstr "さらに料理に加えるように、サラは手元にある豚肉を切り刻み、串焼きで調理した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
