msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Why was this happening, she thought."
msgstr "なぜこんなことになっているのか、彼女は思った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A beautiful woman like that, dominated by a man like that."
msgstr "あんなに美しい女性が、あんな男に支配されるなんて。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Was it power?"
msgstr "それは権力だったのだろうか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Did his wealth and status buy him the right to have women like that?"
msgstr "彼の富と地位が、あのような女性を手に入れる権利を買ってくれたのだろうか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Or did his wealth and power make up for the lack of his other features?"
msgstr "それとも、彼の富と権力が、他の魅力の欠如を補っていたのだろうか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched the young woman throw back her head and cry out as she finished."
