msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "How had she come to forget this so quickly?"
msgstr "どうして彼女はこんなに早くこのことを忘れてしまったのだろうか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The man held up a cup in his hand."
msgstr "男は手にカップを掲げた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
