msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He held the cup up again."
msgstr "彼は再び杯を掲げた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Cassius"
msgid "Another, if you wouldn't mind."
msgstr "もう一杯、よろしく。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah nodded, and began to refill his cup again."
msgstr "サラは頷き、彼の杯を再び満たし始めた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "It repeated a few more times before his thirst seemed finally sated."
msgstr "それはさらに数回繰り返され、ようやく彼の渇きが癒えたようだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Are you...pleased, sir?"
msgstr "ご満足いただけて…嬉しいのですか、卿？"

