msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Don't worry about that."
msgstr "そのことは気にしないで。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Belmont was cruel to you."
msgstr "ベルモント船長はあなたに残酷だったのね。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I don't care about such things."
msgstr "そんなことには興味ないわ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I care about what is in here."
msgstr "ここにあるものが気になるの。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She pressed the palm of her hand more firmly on his chest."
msgstr "彼女は彼の胸に手のひらをさらに強く押し当てた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He had a good heart, she was sure of that."
msgstr "彼は心根が優しい男だった、彼女は確信していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Leaning in, they pressed their lips up against one another."
msgstr "身を寄せ合い、二人は互いの唇に唇を押し当てた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As they fell into the improvised bed, their hands eagerly seized on one another's body."
