msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Was he fighting somewhere? Or had he perhaps retired from war, becoming a blacksmith somewhere? She had dreamed him up a hundred lives, but knew none to be true."
msgstr "彼はどこかで戦っていたのだろうか？それとも、戦争から引退して、どこかで鍛冶屋になっていたのだろうか？彼女は彼の人生を百通りも夢に見たが、どれも真実ではないと分かっていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But in all her dreams there was single fact."
