msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As she came, it took every inch of restraint she had to keep herself from crying out."
msgstr "絶頂を迎える彼女にとって、叫び声を上げずにいるには、持てる自制心のすべてが必要だった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "From the climax, she could feel the pleasure recede, fading almost as quickly as it had come."
msgstr "最高潮から、彼女は快感が引いていくのを感じた。それは来た時と同じ速さで消えかけていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She motioned her own fingers inside herself, drawing out what last drops of pleasure she could from her orgasm, but then pulled her own hands free again."
