msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She suddenly felt herself become hyper aware of the sweat on her body."
msgstr "彼女は突然、自分の体についた汗を鋭敏に意識するようになった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A soft post orgasm serenity came over her, and all her senses felt heightened."
