msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Other than for simply its own sake, Sarah discovered that the efforts of pleasuring herself had cleared up her mind."
msgstr "単に自己満足のためだけでなく、自分を喜ばせる行為によって心が晴れ渡ったことにサラは気づいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A peaceful mood came over her as she sank deeper into the bed, until eventually, she could no longer resist the pull of sleep."
msgstr "ベッドに深く沈み込むにつれて、穏やかな気分が彼女を包み込み、やがて彼女はもはや眠りの引力に抗うことができなくなった。"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "It's not your fight, don't do anything"
msgstr "戦わなくていい、何もする必要はない"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt nothing but pity for the girl."
msgstr "サラはその少女に同情しか感じなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But this was a world ruled by strength."
msgstr "しかし、ここは力によって支配される世界だった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Ruled by those that had it, against those that didn't."
msgstr "権力を持つ者たちによって、持たない者たちに対して支配されているのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah had long fought to find her way back to having some fraction of power."
msgstr "サラは力を少しでも取り戻すために、長い間闘ってきたのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She wasn't about to waste it on saving this girl. This girl who meant nothing to her."
msgstr "彼女は、この少女を助けるためにその力を無駄にするつもりはなかった。この少女は彼女にとって何の意味もなかったのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah stumbled onto her feet."
msgstr "サラはよろめきながら立ち上がった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Near the feet of the dais, she could see the soldiers lined up, throwing their stolen loot on the stairs, trying to outbid one another."
msgstr "壇台の足元では、兵士たちが整列し、盗んだ戦利品を階段の上に投げ込み、互いに競り合っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "One would win, and the poor girl would suffer whomever it was."
msgstr "誰かが勝つだろう。そして、その貧しい少女は、勝った者に苦しめられることになるだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt a stab in her heart. Had she made a mistake?"
msgstr "サラは胸に鋭い痛みを感じた。自分は間違っていたのだろうか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She shook her head and turned around."
msgstr "彼女は首を横に振って振り返った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She forced herself to walk, to keep walking. Leave it all behind."
msgstr "彼女は無理やり歩みを進め、歩き続けるよう自分に言い聞かせた。すべてを後ろに残していくのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As she exited the throne room and stepped back out into the hallways of the palace, she instantly felt relief."
msgstr "王座の間を出て宮殿の廊下に戻った途端、彼女は安堵を感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The noise from the soldiers in the throne room was muted."
msgstr "王座の間の兵士たちの騒ぎは静かになっていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The blistering heat was replaced with the cool desert night."
msgstr "灼熱の暑さは、涼しい砂漠の夜に取って代わられた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt her skin tingle as a breeze passed over her."
msgstr "サラは、そよ風が肌を撫でるのを感じて、肌がぞくぞくとした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "This was the path she had decided on, and she wouldn't allow her own emotions to drag her down. She had a destiny to meet."
msgstr "これが彼女が決めた道であり、自らの感情に引きずられることなど断じて許さなかった。彼女には果たすべき運命があったのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As she began to walk down the hallway, back towards her room in the western wing, Sarah spotted the occasional small group of soldiers."
msgstr "廊下を歩き始め、西翼にある自室へと戻っていくと、サラは時折、兵士たちの小さな集まりを目にした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Some greeted her as she passed, many more were far too deep into either their drinks or their games."
msgstr "通り過ぎる際に何人かが挨拶してくれたが、そのほとんどは酒やゲームに夢中すぎて気づいていなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Passing one group, Sarah noticed about six soldiers playing a game of bone-dice."
msgstr "あるグループを通り過ぎた時、サラは骨のダイスゲームをしている兵士が六人ほどいるのに気づいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Growing up, Sarah had never so much as heard of the game, but among the lower classes it was rather popular."
msgstr "子供の頃、サラはそのゲームについて聞いたことさえなかったが、下層階級の間ではかなり人気があった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Part a game of chance and part one of bluffing."
msgstr "それは運の要素とブラフの要素がそれぞれ半分ずつ含まれていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "It allowed for just enough randomness than anyone could win a hand or so, but also required enough skill that the better player would always win out over the others in the long term."
msgstr "それは、誰にでも一度くらいは勝てるほどの偶然の要素を含みつつも、長期的には腕のいいプレイヤーが常に他の者たちを打ち負かすほどの技術も必要としていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A male soldier stepped up and threw a pair of dice. Some of them cheered, others groaned, making it clear who'd won this round."
msgstr "男性兵士が前に出てダイスを投げた。一部の者たちは歓声を上げ、他の者たちはうめき声を漏らし、このラウンドの勝者が誰であるかを明確にした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A female soldier next to him snatched the dice from the floor and nearly instantly cast them again."
msgstr "熟練した手つきで、女性兵士はダイスの半分ほどを拾い上げ、残りの半分は投げたままの状態にした後、もう一度ダイスを振った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "With a practiced pace, the female soldier grabbed about half the dice up, leaving the other half as they had been thrown, and cast the others a second time."
msgstr "慣れた手つきで、女性兵士はダイスの半分ほどを掴み上げ、残りの半分は振られたままの位置に残した上で、それらを二度目に振った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "There were a lot of rules, tricks and strategies, and Sarah had to confess she'd never really mastered the game."
msgstr "ルールやトリック、戦略は数多くあり、サラは自分がこのゲームを本当にマスターしたことはないと認めざるを得なかった。"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Talk to the male soldier"
msgstr "男の兵士と話す"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt her eyes linger on the male soldier."
msgstr "サラは男性兵士から目が離せなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She'd never met him before, but that wasn't too surprising. The mercenary company had more than two-thousand soldiers, she would never know every face."
msgstr "彼女は彼に会ったことがなかったが、それはそれほど驚くことではなかった。傭兵団には二千人以上の兵士がおり、彼女がすべての顔を覚えているはずもなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He was handsome, in a rugged sort of way."
msgstr "彼は荒々しい感じのハンサムな男だった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The kind where you felt as though you knew who they were just by seeing them. Uncomplicated. Honest."
msgstr "彼らは、ただ姿を見ただけで、その人物が誰であるか分かるようなタイプだった。単純で、誠実な。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Her eyes drifted further down along the shapes of his body."
