msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "For the Mythran empire, slavery was a common thing. It was obvious and unremarkable."
msgstr "ミトラ帝国にとって、奴隷制度はごく当たり前のことだった。それは明白であり、何ら特筆すべきことでもなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Legions such as this one were often supported by a slave host, nearly equal in size to the army itself."
