msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "What was her tragedy then, she thought?"
msgstr "では、彼女の悲劇とは何だったのだろうか、と彼女は思った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "That she had lost something that had never been hers to begin with?"
msgstr "彼女が失ったものが、そもそも最初から彼女のものではなかったということか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She was just a woman. No more. No less."
msgstr "彼女はただの女だった。それ以上でもなく、それ以下でもない。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As she forced herself to her feet, her thoughts were not with the guards or Alaric."
msgstr "彼女が無理やり立ち上がろうとする中、彼女の思考は衛兵やアラリックには向いていなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Both seemed strangely distant. Part of that same, other life."
msgstr "両方とも奇妙に遠く感じられた。それもまた、あの別の人生の一部だった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Of what came before."
msgstr "それ以前の出来事について。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Now, she would lead her life after."
msgstr "今や、彼女はこれからの人生を歩むことになるのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In the days after, Sarah made her way towards the city district, close to the wharf, that had previously only heard rumors of."
msgstr "その後数日、サラは埠頭に近い街の地区へと向かった。そこは以前、噂にしか触れたことのない場所だった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Here, a woman could practice an old trade, for a fair price."
msgstr "ここでは、女性が昔ながらの商売を適正な価格で営むことができるのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Unthinkable once. Now, seemingly, so obvious."
msgstr "かつては考えられなかったこと。今では、どうやら当たり前のことのように思える。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She wanted to live on her own terms. Depend on nobody. Survive."
msgstr "彼女は自分の条件で生きたいと願っていた。誰にも頼らず。生き残るために。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Here, for a price, a woman could do just that."
msgstr "ここでは、対価さえ払えば、女性もかつては考えられなかったようなことをできるようになったのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Still beautiful and having aged with the grace of royalty, Sarah found plenty of offers from those that ran the brothels."
msgstr "まだ美しく、王族のような優雅さで年を重ねたサラは、娼館を営む者たちから数多くの申し出を受けていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She chose one, though in years after, would not recall why this brothel instead of another."
msgstr "彼女は一つを選んだが、何年も経ってから、なぜ他の娼館ではなくこの娼館だったのか思い出せなくなることになる。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Her first few customers took some getting used to, but she learned faster than she had expected herself."
msgstr "最初の数人の客には慣れるのに少し時間がかかったが、彼女は自分でも予想していた以上に早く適応していった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Her beauty made her popular, and she could play and feign with conversation, to be more than just a body."
msgstr "彼女の美しさが彼女を人気者にし、会話を通じて演技や偽装をすることで、彼女は単なる身体以上の存在になることができたのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "This too, made her popular."
msgstr "これもまた、彼女を人気者にした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Over the years, she would come to see all kinds."
msgstr "長年の間に、彼女はあらゆる種類の人間に出会うことになる。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Young men, eager to gain some experience. Old men, eager for her youth."
msgstr "若い男たち、経験を積むことに熱心な者たち。年配の男たち、彼女の若さに惹かれる者たち。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Rich men, who used her often. Poor men that saved months to have her for a night."
msgstr "裕福な男たちは彼女を頻繁に利用し、貧しい男たちは彼女と一晩過ごすために何ヶ月も貯金していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Strong. Weak. Tall. Handsome. Ugly."
msgstr "強い者もいれば、弱い者もいる。背の高い者もいれば、ハンサムな者もいる。醜い者もいる。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "All the same. All men."
msgstr "それでも。男は皆同じだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Save a rare few, she could hardly recall one face from the other, as years passed."
msgstr "稀な例外を除けば、年月が経つにつれて、彼女は彼らの顔をほとんど区別できなくなっていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saved her coin well enough, lived within her means, and purchased a home in the city."
msgstr "彼女は金をうまく貯め、身の丈に合った生活を送り、街に家を購入していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As she aged, she was wise that her days in the trade would not last forever."
msgstr "年を重ねるにつれ、彼女はこの仕事で過ごす日々が永遠ではないことを悟っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She kept a few reliable customers, and lived off the decent sum she had saved."
msgstr "彼女には信頼できる顧客が何人かおり、貯めた十分な金で暮らしていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Live was not bad, though it was not the life she had ever dreamed over."
msgstr "生活は悪くなかったが、それは彼女がかつて夢見ていた人生ではなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But as she looked out over the streets that had become her home..."
msgstr "しかし、彼女が自分の故郷となった街の通りを見渡したとき…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "For whatever life it might have been, good or bad, she was always certain that it had been her life."
msgstr "どんな人生であれ、それが良いものであろうと悪いものであろうと、彼女はそれが自分の人生だったと常に確信していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Her choice."
msgstr "彼女の選択だ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Exile to thief."
msgstr "追放者から盗人へ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Thief to prostitute."
msgstr "盗賊から売春婦へ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I'll do anything you want..."
msgstr "あなたの望むことは何でもします…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saw their wicked grins widen."
msgstr "彼女は二人の男たちの邪悪な笑みが広がるのを見た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The two men fumbled at their belts, quick and clumsy."
msgstr "二人の男はベルトに手を伸ばし、素早く、しかし不器用にもがいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He released his grip on her wrist."
msgstr "彼は彼女の腕首から手を離した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Just as one of the men managed to drop his pants, Sarah lunged forward."
msgstr "男の一人がようやくズボンを下ろしたその瞬間、サラが飛びかかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Driving her knee hard into his groin, she heard a sickening crunch."
msgstr "彼の股間に膝を強く叩きつけると、彼女は吐き気を催すような音が聞こえた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The man did not so much scream, as choke on his own gasp."
msgstr "男は叫ぶというより、自身の息を詰まらせるような音を立てた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His hands reaching for his crotch, he collapsed with a gurggling noise."
msgstr "彼は股間に手を伸ばすと、ぐちゃりという音を立てて倒れた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The other man, drunk and his pants halfway around his legs, fumbled as he tried to grab her again."
msgstr "もう一人の男は、酔っ払ってズボンを半ば下ろしたまま、再び彼女を捕まえようと手探りした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But Sarah easily dodged him this time."
msgstr "だがサラは今回、彼を容易にかわした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The pants around his ankles, he tripped."
msgstr "足首までずれたズボンのまま、彼はつまずいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Too drunk or too slow to catch himsel from falling, his face made the sound of breaking rocks as he hit the cobblestone."
msgstr "酔いすぎて、あるいは鈍すぎて自ら転倒を防ぐこともできず、男は石畳に叩きつけられると、顔から岩が砕けるような音を立てた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "For a brief moment, Sarah smiled as she took in the sight of the cruel men laid low."
msgstr "一瞬だけ、サラは微笑んだ。残酷な男たちが打ち倒された光景を彼女が目にすると。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Then she turned to run."
msgstr "それから彼女は走り出した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As she dashed through the streets again, she heard no sounds of anyone giving chase."
msgstr "再び街路を駆け抜ける中、彼女は追跡する者の音など一切聞こえなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "There were people, off in the main streets, working, shopping, but nobody noticed or cared for her."
msgstr "主通りでは人々が仕事や買い物に追われていたが、彼女に気づく者も、気にかける者もいなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She ducked between crates and barrels, doing her best not to get noticed again."
msgstr "彼女は木箱や樽の間をすり抜け、再び気づかれないよう必死に行動した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah could feel herself, hyper aware of her own naked skin."
msgstr "サラは自分自身を感じていた。剥き出しの肌が過剰に意識されるほどに。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She had to get off the streets..."
msgstr "彼女は路上から抜け出さなければならなかった…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Something...anything..."
msgstr "何か…何でもいいから…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Then, out of nowhere, one hand wrapped around her mouth, and another around her arms."
msgstr "すると、不意に片手が彼女の口を覆い、もう片方の手が両腕を掴んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Guards. The men."
msgstr "衛兵たち。男たちだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah could feel her lungs start to burn as she struggled to breathe."
msgstr "サラは呼吸しようと必死に抗ったが、肺が燃え始めるのを感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "This...was this really how it would end..."
msgstr "これは…本当にこんな結末になるのか…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gods..."
msgstr "神様…"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't make a sound."
msgstr "音を立てるな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His voice was a harsh whisper in her ear."
msgstr "彼の声は彼女の耳元で荒々しい囁きだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And the moment she heard it, a rush of happiness overtook her, unlike any she had ever heard."
msgstr "そして彼女がそれを聞いた瞬間、これまで感じたことのないほどの幸福感が彼女を包み込んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She simply nodded, and he released the grip."
msgstr "彼女はただ頷いただけで、彼はその手を離した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah turned around and saw Alaric's face in the shadow."
msgstr "サラは振り返り、影の中にアラリックの顔を見た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Before she even realized it, she leapt into his arms."
msgstr "彼女がそれに気づくよりも先に、彼の腕の中に飛び込んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "There, there..."
msgstr "ほら、ほら…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She could hear the smile in his voice, as if nothing bad had happened at all."
msgstr "彼の声には笑みがこもっていた。まるで、悪いことは何も起こらなかったかのように。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As if everything was going to be okay again."
msgstr "まるで、すべてがまた元通りになるかのように。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Instantly, she felt safe."
msgstr "途端に、彼女は安心感を覚えた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Here."
msgstr "ほら。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He handed her a blanket and she eagerly wrapped it around herself."
msgstr "彼は彼女に毛布を渡し、彼女はそれを熱心に体に巻き付けた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "What...what are we..."
msgstr "何…何が起こっているの…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah struggled to get the words out, her voice still trembling."
msgstr "サラは言葉を絞り出そうともがき、声はまだ震えていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Instead, she felt his strong arms, tightening his grip around her, pulling her closer."
msgstr "代わりに、彼女は彼の強い腕を感じた。彼は彼女をより強く抱きしめ、近くに引き寄せた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't worry. I got you."
msgstr "心配しないで。私が守るから。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Slowly, Sarah could feel her heart settle."
msgstr "ゆっくりと、サラは心臓が落ち着いていくのを感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I thought I'd lost you..."
msgstr "あなたを失ったかと思った…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She finally managed to get the words out."
msgstr "彼女はついに言葉を口に出すことができた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "When she looked up she just saw his wide grin."
msgstr "彼女が顔を上げると、彼の満面の笑みが目に飛び込んできた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Me?"
msgstr "俺だと？"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You think that's my first run in with the law?"
msgstr "それが俺と法の最初の遭遇だと思ってんのか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "They make a lotta noise but they ain't much trouble."
msgstr "彼らは大騒ぎするけど、大した厄介者じゃないんだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You mean we're safe?"
msgstr "安全だということ？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric shook his head."
msgstr "アラリックは首を振った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Nah, not quite yet."
msgstr "いや、まだ完全には違う。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "The city guard are like dogs, they do whatever their masters tell them."
msgstr "街の衛兵なんて犬みたいなもんだ。主人に言われたことなら何でもやる。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "For now, that means chasing thieves out of the market."
msgstr "今のところ、それは市場から泥棒を追いかけることを意味する。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah frowned, that seemed like a rather large problem, given that this was how they made their money."
msgstr "サラは眉をひそめた。これが自分たちの稼ぎ方であることを考えれば、それはかなり大きな問題に思えた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "So...what do we do then?"
msgstr "じゃあ…どうすればいいの？"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Simple, we give them what they want."
msgstr "簡単だ。奴らが欲しいものを渡せばいい。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We lay off the action for a while, keep our heads down, don't cause nobody no trouble."
msgstr "しばらくは活動を控え、目立たず、誰にも迷惑をかけないようにしよう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "In a few weeks, the guards report that crime is down in the markets."
msgstr "数週間もすれば、衛兵たちは市場での犯罪が減少したと報告するだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Then before you know it, some dock master will whine to the city guard that thieving is up in the harbor."
msgstr "そうしているうちに、いつの間にか、どこかの港の責任者が市衛兵隊に、港での窃盗が増えていると文句を言うようになるだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Then they'll go and harass people on that side of town."
msgstr "そして彼らは街のあちら側の人々を嫌がらせしに行くだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He smiled as if it was all so obvious."
msgstr "彼は、すべてが当然であるかのように微笑んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Trust me, they never stick around too long."
msgstr "信じてくれ、彼らは長くは留まらないからな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Not enough of em, and those that are, too lazy to work hard for more than a few days."
msgstr "彼らは足りていないし、いる者たちも、数日分以上は一生懸命働くのが面倒くさいだけだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "It was comforting to think there was a strategy, a plan. And who was she to argue? Alaric had years of experience, compared to her few weeks."
msgstr "戦略や計画があると思うと、心強かった。それに、彼女に何の権利があって反論できるというのか？アルリックには長年の経験があるのに対し、彼女には数週間の経験しかないのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Okay...so..."
msgstr "ええと…それで…"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "What do we do about the patrols?"
msgstr "パトロール隊はどうすればいいの？"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We have to get off the streets."
msgstr "街を離れなきゃならん。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Buddy of mine got a spot we can lay low at, I've used it before."
msgstr "俺の仲間のところに、身を隠せる場所があるんだ。前にも使ったことがある。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Just follow me and keep you head down."
msgstr "ただ俺についてきて、頭を低くしておけ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "And for the love of the Gods, keep that cloak shut, last thing we need is you drawin any unwanted attention, and your naked tits are sure to do that."
msgstr "神様のためにも、そのマントをしっかり閉じておけ。これ以上、余計な注目を集める必要はないだろう。お前の裸の胸がそれを引き起こすのは確実だ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt her face turn red, but simply nodded."
msgstr "サラは顔が赤くなるのを感じたが、ただ頷くだけだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric led the way and Sarah followed."
msgstr "アラリックが先導し、サラは後をついていった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Cutting through the maze of alleys, they exited onto a busier street."
msgstr "迷路のような路地を抜け、二人はより賑やかな通りに出た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "While she could spot a few guards from the corners of her eyes, they didn't seem to pay them much attention."
msgstr "彼女は視界の隅で数人の衛兵を捉えていたが、彼らは衛兵に大して注意を払っていないようだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "They moved quick, cutting and dashing through the crowds."
msgstr "二人は素早く動き、人混みを切り裂くように駆け抜けていった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Always, just when it seemed someone might look at them, they'd cut through another alley, and come out somewhere knew."
msgstr "サラはアラリックにぴったりと寄り添っていた。彼はまるでこの街を完全に把握しているかのようだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah stayed close to Alaric, who seemed to know the city by heart."
msgstr "サラはアラリックのそばに寄り添っていた。彼はまるでこの街を心で知っているかのように動いていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Running through it, it all felt exhilarating."
msgstr "走り抜けるうちに、すべてが爽快で刺激的に感じられた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And unlike before, she felt no fear."
msgstr "そして以前とは違い、彼女は何の恐怖も感じていなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric, for whatever else he was, made her feel safe."
msgstr "アラリックは、彼が他にどんな人物であれ、彼女に安心感を与えていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "They ended up in a decidedly poorer part of town. Boarded up windows, drunkards, trash heaped up."
msgstr "結局、彼らは明らかに貧しい街の一角にたどり着いた。窓は板で塞がれ、酔っ払いがうろつき、ゴミが山積みになっていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Roofs with so many holes in them, you'd wonder what the point of the roof still was."
msgstr "屋根に穴があまりにも多すぎて、そもそも屋根がある意味があるのかと思えるほどだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric suddenly stopped and knocked on a door."
msgstr "アラリックは突然立ち止まり、ドアをノックした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "They waited for a moment, and Alaric knocked again."
msgstr "彼らはしばらく待った後、アラリックが再びノックした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Then, finally, they heard movement from the other side and the door slowly opened."
msgstr "そしてついに、向こう側から物音が聞こえ、ドアがゆっくりと開いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A man with a round face slowly peaked out, his eyes narrowing."
msgstr "丸顔の男がゆっくりと顔を出し、目を細めた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Fuck...you again..."
msgstr "クソ…またお前か…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric grinned."
msgstr "アラリックはにやりと笑った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That's no way to greet an old friend."
msgstr "昔の友人にそんな挨拶の仕方はないだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Friend, huh?"
msgstr "友だち、だと？"

msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Come by just to pass the time with me, then?"
msgstr "じゃあ、ただ私と時間をつぶすために寄ってきたの？"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Well...of course..."
msgstr "ええ…もちろん…"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "And uh...if we could maybe spend the night here, that would really help us out."
msgstr "ええと…もしここで一晩過ごしてもらえたら、本当に助かるんだけど。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The man's eyes narrowed further."
msgstr "男の目はさらに細められた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Stay the night, huh?"
msgstr "一晩泊まるって、そうかい？"

msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "I heard the guards kickin up a storm. Figured it wouldn't be long before you came a knockin."
msgstr "衛兵たちが大騒ぎしているのを聞いていた。君が訪ねてくるのも時間の問題だろうと踏んでいたんだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You know me too well, I guess."
msgstr "君は私のことをよく知りすぎているようだね。"

msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "And who is this we?"
msgstr "で、この「我々」とは一体誰のことなんだ？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The man peaked out a little further and only just now saw Sarah."
msgstr "男はもう少しだけ顔を出し、その時になってようやくサラの姿に気づいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "My new friend here, Sarah."
msgstr "ここの新しい友人、サラだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "So you're askin me to shelter not just you, but this other fool you've roped in with you?"
msgstr "じゃあ、あんたは俺に、自分だけじゃなく、連れてきたこの馬鹿まで匿えって言うのか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Man"
msgid "Figure that's twice the rent then."
msgstr "それじゃあ、家賃は倍になるわけだな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "How quickly you're all business, Hugh."
msgstr "ヒュー、随分とすぐに仕事の話に入るんだな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Sweet talk all you want, Alaric."
msgstr "いくら甘い言葉を並べても無駄だ、アラリック。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Pay up or find some other fool that will risk a noose on you and your lady friend."
msgstr "払うか、それともお前とその女房に首吊り縄をかけるリスクを冒すような他の馬鹿を見つけるかだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric reached into his pocket and produced a coin."
msgstr "アラリックはポケットに手を入れ、硬貨を取り出した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Coin."
msgstr "硬貨だ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Enough to cover my tab, and plenty more for a few nights."
msgstr "これで俺の請求は済むし、数夜分も余裕で稼げるな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You get to do a good deed and make some money too."
msgstr "お前は善行もできるし、金も稼げるんだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah saw the way Hugh's eyes locked in on the coin."
msgstr "サラはヒューの目がコインに釘付けになっているのを見た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Suddenly, the door swung open."
msgstr "突然、ドアが勢いよく開いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Come in and be quick then. I take it nobody followed you?"
msgstr "さあ、中に入って、早くしろ。誰もついてきてないんだろうな？"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Of course not."
msgstr "もちろん違うさ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric stepped inside and Sarah quickly followed."
msgstr "アラリックが中に入り、サラもすぐに後を追った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She heard the sound of the door falling shut behind them."
msgstr "彼女は、ドアが背後で閉まる音を聞いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Inside, the room was dark, but even with little light, she could tell the room was in a poor condition."
msgstr "部屋の中は暗かったが、わずかな光でも、その部屋が劣悪な状態にあることは彼女には分かった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Then again, she had spend her previous nights sleeping in an alley, so even this place seemed a luxury."
msgstr "それにしても、彼女はこれまで路地裏で寝泊まりしていたのだから、こんな場所さえも贅沢に思えた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "So...about that coin then..."
msgstr "それで…そのコインの件だけど…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She could see his eyes still hungry."
msgstr "彼の目にはまだ飢えが宿っているのが見えた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric nodded and threw the coin over at Hugh, who grasped at it desperately."
msgstr "アラリックは頷き、ヒューに向かってコインを投げた。ヒューはそれを必死に掴もうとした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Good...this is...a good start..."
msgstr "いい…これは…良い始まりだ…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah thought the man seemed almost entranced by the coin."
msgstr "サラは、その男がコインにほとんど心を奪われているように見えた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I've got more to cover our stay. So long as you keep the guards off our back."
msgstr "滞在期間中の他の用事も片付けなければならない。衛兵が我々の邪魔をしないようにしてくれればの話だが。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hugh pocketed the coin and smiled."
msgstr "ヒューはコインをポケットにしまい、微笑んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Half the guards are imbeciles, the other half are more corrupt than you."
msgstr "気にするな。衛兵の半分は愚か者で、残りの半分は君よりも腐敗しているんだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Don't worry about it."
msgstr "心配するな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "So long as you can pay, you're in no trouble at all."
msgstr "支払いさえできれば、何の問題もない。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hugh pointed up at the boarded up windows."
msgstr "ヒューは板で塞がれた窓を指さした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Remember, don't leave, don't show your face through the windows."
msgstr "忘れないでくれ。ここを離れたり、窓から顔を出したりするな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "You need anything, you let me know and I'll get it for you."
msgstr "何か必要なものがあれば、知らせてくれれば手配してやるよ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Good, how for a start, some food and drinks for me and my friend here."
msgstr "いいだろう。まずは、私とここにいる友人のために、食料と飲み物を用意してくれないか。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hugh nodded."
msgstr "ヒューは頷いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Of course. I'll give you some of what I have in store."
msgstr "もちろんです。私が持っているものの中から、いくつかお渡ししましょう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "Tomorrow, I'll go to the market and I can bring back whatever you want."
msgstr "明日、市場へ行って、君が欲しいものを何でも持ってきてあげよう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "At a premium, no doubt."
msgstr "高値で売れるに違いないだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Hugh smiled."
msgstr "ヒューは微笑んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "You pay for the rent. You pay for the service."
msgstr "家賃は君が払うんだ。サービス代も君が払う。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "You want free, you hike back to whatever backwater you came out of."
msgstr "無料で欲しいなら、お前が来たあの辺鄙な場所まで自分で戻れ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah could see the subtle changes in Alaric's posture."
msgstr "サラはアラリックの姿勢に現れた微妙な変化に気づいていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He could take an insult, but he couldn't stand to be talked down to."
msgstr "彼は侮辱なら受け入れられたが、見下されることには耐えられなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "How about you go and do all that."
msgstr "じゃあ、自分で全部やってみたらどうだ？"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Leave the food by the door, my friend and I are going to be busy for a while."
msgstr "食料をドアのそばに置いておいてくれ。俺と友人はしばらく忙しくなるからな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saw him give a cold stare to Hugh."
msgstr "彼女は彼がヒューを冷たく睨みつけるのを見た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Hugh"
msgid "I...uhh...of course. It's your room."
msgstr "ええと……もちろんです。ここはあなたの部屋ですから。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The man staggered out, closing the door behind him."
msgstr "男はふらつきながら出ていき、背後でドアを閉めた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric turned to her."
msgstr "アラリックは彼女の方を向いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Finally, we're alone."
msgstr "やっと二人きりになったな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "That fatso runs a solid hideout, but he doesn't know when to shut it."
msgstr "あのデブは堅固な隠れ家を経営しているが、いつ口を閉ざすべきか分かっていないな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah smiled awkardly. It felt odd to insult their host behind his back."
msgstr "サラは気まずそうに微笑んだ。主人の陰で彼を侮辱するなんて、奇妙な気分だった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "He seems...decent enough."
msgstr "彼は…まあ、まともな人間のようね。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric frowned."
msgstr "アラリックは眉をひそめた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Decent?"
msgstr "まともだと？"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "He's as much a criminal as any you'll find in this town. He's just good enough at it that he can pretend to be above it all."
msgstr "彼はこの町で出会うどんな犯罪者とも同じくらい悪党だ。ただ、その腕前が十分優れているから、自分が高潔な存在であるかのように装えるだけだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "If he's so bad...why are we staying with him?"
msgstr "彼がそんなに悪い奴なら…なんで私たちは彼と一緒にいるの？"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Because Hugh likes coin."
msgstr "ヒューは金が好きだからだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "He's a simple creature like that."
msgstr "彼はそういう単純な生き物なんだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "We keep up our end, he can be trusted to keep up his end."
msgstr "我々が自分の分をちゃんと果たしているなら、彼も自分の分をちゃんと果たしてくれると信じていいだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric sat down on the bed."
msgstr "アラリックはベッドに腰掛けた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You help fugitives like us, you risk the noose here in Lethram."
msgstr "我々のような逃亡者を助けることで、君はレスラムで絞首刑になる危険を冒しているのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You won't find too many folk that will do that out of the kindness of their hearts."
msgstr "心からの善意だけでそんなことをしてくれる人々は、そう多くはないだろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah sat down next to Alaric."
msgstr "サラはアラリックの隣に腰掛けた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You've worked with him before."
msgstr "以前も彼と協力したことがあるでしょう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Couple times, when things got too hot."
msgstr "何度か、状況が過熱しすぎた時にはね。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Hide out a few days, weeks...let it cool down, and you're good as new."
msgstr "数日、数週間ほど身を隠して、事態が冷めるのを待てば、また元通りになるさ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah looked closely at Alaric's face."
msgstr "サラはアラリックの顔を注意深く観察した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "He mentioned a tab...what was that about?"
msgstr "彼はタブについて言及していたけど…あれは何のことだったの？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric frowned, looking annoyed."
msgstr "アラリックは眉をひそめ、苛立った様子だった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "What do you care?"
msgstr "何の関係があるんだ？"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...I was just wondering...this is all new for me."
msgstr "わ…私はただ、不思議で…これは全部初めてのことだから。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I owe him some from last time I was put up here, and I couldn't pay in full."
msgstr "前回ここに泊まった時に彼に借りを作ったんだが、全額払うことができなかったんだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "But that won't be a problem, we got plenty with us now."
msgstr "でも、それは問題にならない。今なら十分なものがあるからな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Alaric shook the bag of coins, the sum of their haul."
msgstr "アラリックはコインの入った袋を揺らし、彼らが手に入れた全額を示した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "But what about-"
msgstr "でも、その…"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Gods."
msgstr "ちくしょう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Do you ever shut the fuck up?"
msgstr "お前は黙る気はないのか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt his harsh words on her like a whip."
msgstr "サラは彼の厳しい言葉が鞭のように身に染みるのを感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "You were out on the streets, naked, not a clue in that brain of yours."
msgstr "お前は街を裸でうろついてたんだぞ。その頭の中には何一つ分かってなかったんだからな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "If not for me, saving you, that guards woulda caught you and you'd be swingin from a rope or worse by now."
msgstr "俺がいなかったら、お前を救わなかったら、衛兵に捕まって、今頃は縄で首を吊られてるか、もっとひどい目に遭ってたはずだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah lowered her head and nodded."
msgstr "サラは頭を下げ、頷いた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He was. If not for him...she didn't want to think about it."
msgstr "彼はそうだった。もし彼がいなければ……彼女はそれについて考えたくもなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Good, so at least we're clear that I save you from your own stupidity."
msgstr "いいだろう。少なくとも、私が君を君自身の愚かさから救ったことははっきりしたな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "How about, instead of askin me a hundred questions, you put that mouth to good use."
msgstr "百もの質問をする代わりに、その口をちゃんと使ってみたらどうだ？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah watched as Alarice leaned back and began to take his clothes off."
msgstr "サラは、アラリックが後ろに寄りかかり、服を脱ぎ始めるのを見ていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As he slid his pants down, his massive cock jumped free, already hard."
msgstr "ズボンを下ろしていくと、彼の巨大なペニスが飛び出し、すでに硬く立っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah found it hard to look away."
msgstr "サラはそこから目を離すのが難しかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "By now, instinctively, she dropped down to the ground on her knees."
msgstr "今や、本能的に、彼女は地面に膝をついた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Reaching up with her hands, she wrapped it around his thick shaft, and angled the tip to her lips."
msgstr "手を伸ばし、彼女は彼の太いシャフトを包み込み、先端を唇の方へ傾けた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "This, she could do..."
msgstr "これなら、彼女にはできた……"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "This was something she was useful for..."
msgstr "これは彼女が役に立つことだった…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She parted her lips and took him into her mouth."
msgstr "彼女は唇を開き、彼を口の中に含んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Above her, she heard a loud and approving groan coming from Alaric."
msgstr "彼女の上から、アラリックの大きく、満足げなうめき声が聞こえてきた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Fuck..."
msgstr "くそっ…"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "I was startin to forget why I bothered to save you...now I remember."
msgstr "お前を助けるために苦労したことを忘れかけていたんだが…今思い出したよ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She felt his forceful hand on the back of her head."
msgstr "彼女は彼の力強い手が後頭部を押さえるのを感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Gripping her hair, he began to dictate her rhythm, her pace."
msgstr "彼女の髪を掴み、彼は彼女のリズムとペースを支配し始めた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "It was easy with him, Sarah thought, because he always knew exactly what he wanted from her."
msgstr "彼といるのは楽だった、とサラは思った。なぜなら、彼はいつも彼女から何を望んでいるのかを正確に知っていたからだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah continued moving her head to his instructions."
msgstr "サラは彼の指示に従って頭を動かし続けた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Running her tongue along the length of his shaft."
msgstr "彼のペニスの全長に沿って舌を滑らせた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Practice, and training, she thought as she serviced him with her mouth."
msgstr "練習、そして訓練だ、と彼女は彼を口で奉仕しながら思った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As she raised her head and lowered herself, taking his cock further into her throat, she could not help but think of how odd it all was."
msgstr "頭を上げ下げし、彼のペニスをさらに喉の奥まで受け入れながら、彼女はこれがどれほど奇妙なことか考えずにはいられなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Here, with him, in this horrid place."
msgstr "ここ、彼と共に、この恐ろしい場所で。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And yet all of it felt so right."
msgstr "それでも、すべてがごく自然に感じられた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She remembered the fear in the alley, when she had been alone..."
msgstr "彼女は路地裏で一人だった時の恐怖を思い出していた…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And how safe she now felt with him."
msgstr "そして今、彼と共にいることで、彼女はどれほど安全だと感じていたことか。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He was a brute, of that she had no illusions."
msgstr "彼は野蛮な男だった。その点については、彼女も幻想を抱いていなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But he was hers."
msgstr "でも、彼は彼女のものだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As cruel and violent as he could be, he only ever aimed it at others. Never at her."
msgstr "彼がどれほど残酷で暴力的であっても、その矛先は常に他人に向けられるだけで、彼女には決して向けられなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He was without conscience to others...but to those he loved...a faint tenderness that was hard to see."
msgstr "彼は他人に対しては無慈悲だったが…愛する者たちに対しては…かすかな優しさがあった。それは見つけ出すのが難しいものだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But she could see, and she felt proud of herself for seeing what no one else could."
msgstr "しかし、彼女はそれを見て取ることができた。そして、他の誰にも気づけなかったことに気づいた自分を誇らしく思っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah raised her eyes up as she continued to suck him, and met his gaze."
msgstr "サラは視線を上げながら彼を吸い続け、彼の目と合った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He smiled at her, approvingly."
msgstr "彼は彼女を認め合うように微笑んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And Sarah felt a rush pass through her body, more alert and intimate than any carnal act between them."
msgstr "そしてサラは、体中を駆け巡る衝動を感じた。それは二人の間の肉体的な行為よりも、はるかに覚醒し、親密なものであった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She felt the wetness between her legs, surge."
msgstr "彼女は股間の湿り気が高まっていくのを感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "How far she had come, from her old life back in Castle Reinmeer."
msgstr "彼女がラインミール城での古い生活から、どれほど遠くまで来たことか。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And yet, how faint all of those years seemed now. Vague memories that felt as if they belonged to someone else."
msgstr "それでも、あの年月はすべて今ではどれほどかすかに思えることか。まるで誰か他の人のもののように感じられる、ぼんやりとした記憶だけが残っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "It was easy, to forget, when she was with him."
msgstr "彼と一緒にいる時は、忘れやすかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And she had wanted to forget so much."
msgstr "そして彼女は、多くのことを忘れたいと願っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He ran his hands through her hair, at times gentle and at times pulling it roughly."
msgstr "彼は彼女の髪を撫で、時には優しく、時には乱暴に引っ張った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whenever she thought she understood him, or had figured him out, he would surprise her."
msgstr "彼のことを理解した、あるいは見抜いたと思った瞬間にでも、彼はいつも彼女を驚かせるのだった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Alaric"
msgid "Don't tell me you're falling for me."
msgstr "まさか、俺に惚れちまうなんて言わないだろうな。"

