msgstr "それはお前のせいだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "No, I didn't...I..."
msgstr "いいえ、私は…私は…"

msgctxt "speaker:Alfred"
msgid "I ain't had a woman for years."
msgstr "何年も女とやってないんだ。"

