msgstr "はい、船長。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Are you finding your lodgings in order?"
msgstr "部屋の様子、順調ですか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Thank you for offering them, you didn't need to do that."
msgstr "提供してくださってありがとうございます。そんなことしなくてもよかったのに。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The captain waved his hand, dismissing her humble attitude."
msgstr "船長は手を振って、彼女の謙虚な態度を軽くあしらった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Please, I'm happy to have a mage on the ship. God forbid we get attacked by more of those creatures."
msgstr "どうか、船に魔術師がいてくれて嬉しいよ。またあの手の生き物に襲われたらどうするんだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "We should be safe out here at sea for now."
msgstr "今のところ、この海上なら安全のはずよ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Is that so? Whose to say they can't swim."
msgstr "そうかい？泳げないなんて、誰が言ったんだ？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah frowned. Maybe that was true, she hadn't even considered it."
msgstr "サラは眉をひそめた。もしかしたらそれは真実かもしれない。彼女はそんなこと考えたこともなかったのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Maybe, but I suspect they can't."
msgstr "そうかもだけど、彼らは泳げないんじゃないかと疑っているわ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "I'll take your word on that then."
msgstr "それなら、君の言葉を信じることにするよ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He finally put down the paper he was reading and looked up."
msgstr "彼はようやく読んでいた紙を置き、顔を上げた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Was there anything you needed from me?"
msgstr "ええと、何か私に必要だったものはありましたか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "No, Captain, I just thought I'd check to see if everything was going well."
msgstr "いえ、キャプテン。ただ、すべて順調に進んでいるか確認しようと思っただけです。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I know that the ship is over capacity, so if there's anything you need me to do..."
msgstr "船が定員を超えていることは分かっています。ですから、もし私に何かしていただきたいことがあれば…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Captain shook his head."
msgstr "船長は首を横に振った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "No, it should be fine."
msgstr "いえ、問題ないはずです。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "We're making good speed, so long as the winds remain favorable, we should put some real distance between ourselves and Lethram."
msgstr "風さえ順調であれば、我々はかなりの速さで進んでいる。これでレトラムとの間に十分な距離を置けるはずだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Few more days, we should make it to Rahayal."
msgstr "あと数日もすれば、ラハヤルに到着するはずだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "If the winds turn bad though, we might need to ration food."
msgstr "しかし、風向きが悪くなったら、食料を節約する必要があるかもしれない。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The captain gestured."
msgstr "船長は身振りで合図した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Please, have a seat."
msgstr "どうぞ、お座りください。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah was surprised at the offer, but it felt impolite to refuse."
msgstr "サラはその提案に驚いたが、断るのは失礼だと感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...of course."
msgstr "ええ…もちろんです。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She walked over and set down on the opposite end of the large desk."
msgstr "彼女は歩み寄り、大きな机の反対側に腰を下ろした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The captain leaned back in his chair."
msgstr "船長は椅子に深くもたれかかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Gods, today was supposed to be an easy day. It sure went sideways fast."
msgstr "ちくしょう、今日は簡単な一日になるはずだったのに。あっという間に状況がめちゃくちゃになった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "I haven't even had a meal yet."
msgstr "俺はまだ食事すらしていないんだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "How about you?"
msgstr "君はどうだ？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah suddenly realized sheh hadn't eaten all day either."
msgstr "サラは、自分も一日中何も食べていなかったことに突然気づいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "No, I haven't actually."
msgstr "いいえ、実はまだ食べてないの。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The captain smiled."
msgstr "船長は微笑んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Will you do me the honour of dining with me?"
msgstr "私と一緒に食事をするという栄誉を授けていただけませんか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "I don't get a mage on my ship very often, and I promise that ship's Cook is quite good."
msgstr "私の船に魔術師が乗ってくることは滅多にないが、船の料理人はかなり腕がいいと約束するよ。"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Accept, dine with the Captain"
msgstr "キャプテンと食事をする"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "That's a very kind offer. I'd be happy to accept."
msgstr "それはとても親切なお申し出ですね。喜んでお受けします。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Captain clasped his hands together."
msgstr "船長は両手を組み合わせた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Excellent! I'll have the Cook get started right away."
msgstr "素晴らしい！すぐに料理人に準備を始めさせよう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Before she knew it, the cook had returned and delivered their food."
msgstr "彼女が気づく間もなく、料理人が戻ってきて食事を運んできた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Just as the Captain had said, the feast was quite impressive."
msgstr "船長が言った通り、宴は実に壮観だった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Wow...you get all this on a ship..."
msgstr "わあ…船の上でこんなものが手に入るなんて…"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I always thought sailor food would be more...sparse."
msgstr "船員食って、もっと…質素なものだと思ってたの。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Captain laughed."
msgstr "船長は笑った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "For sailor's, sure. Some bread, maybe some beer."
msgstr "船員食なら、まあね。パンが少し、ビールもあれば、といったところかな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "But there are advantages to being the Captain."
msgstr "だが、船長であることには利点もある。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As they began to eat together, the Captain appeared quite interested in the story of her life."
msgstr "二人が一緒に食事を始めると、船長は彼女の人生の物語に明らかに興味を示した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Captain, for his part, was an easy conversationalist, and she enjoyed speaking to him."
msgstr "キャプテンは話しやすい人物で、彼女は彼と話すことを楽しんでいた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah did her best to tell him a truthful story, without revealing every fact of her life."
msgstr "サラは彼に正直な話をするよう最善を尽くしたが、自分の人生のすべての事実を明かすことはなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He didn't need to know where she came from."
msgstr "彼は彼女がどこから来たかなど知る必要はなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But even telling him about her life as a mage seemed to be more than enough to engage him."
msgstr "しかし、魔法使いとしての彼女の人生について話すだけでも、彼を惹きつけるには十分だったようだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Before she knew it, she was telling him everything that had transpired over the years since she started her studies under Xan."
msgstr "気づく間もなく、彼女はザンの下で学び始めてから数年間にわたって起こった出来事のすべてを彼に話していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Of course, the occasional detail left out, so as not to trouble him too much."
msgstr "もちろん、彼をあまり困らせないように、時折、重要な詳細は省かれていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Likewise, she began to ask the Captain questions about his life."
msgstr "同様に、彼女はキャプテンに彼の人生について質問を始めた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Captain was up there in age, someways into his sixties, but he had spend a lifetime out at sea."
msgstr "キャプテンはもうかなりの年齢で、六十代も半ばに差し掛かっていたが、彼は生涯を海の上で過ごしてきたのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Discipline and hard work had guided him up the ranks from a lowly deckhand to the office that he now held."
msgstr "規律と勤勉さが、彼を卑しい甲板員から現在の地位へと昇進させてきたのだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His appearance matched his personality, strong and firm, he had managed to grow old without the frailties of age."
msgstr "彼の外見は性格と一致していた。強くしっかりしており、彼は年齢による虚弱さもなく老いることができていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Only the grooves on his face and his grey hair marked his age."
msgstr "彼の顔のしわと白髪だけが、彼の年齢を物語っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In the decades of his service, he had sailed across every sea and seen nearly every corner of the world."
msgstr "数十年にわたる職務の中で、彼はあらゆる海を渡り、世界のほぼ隅々まで見てきた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah couldn't help but be impressed and interested to learn more."
msgstr "サラは感心せずにはいられず、さらに詳しく知りたいと思った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Lost in pleasant conversation, the hours had flown by."
msgstr "心地よい会話に夢中になっているうちに、時間はあっという間に過ぎていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Captain held up an empty bottle of wine."
msgstr "キャプテンは空のワインボトルを掲げた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Out, I'm afraid."
msgstr "出て行ってもらおうか。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Unfortunate! I really like that bottle."
msgstr "残念だ！あのボトル、本当に気に入っていたのに。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Captain reached back into his desk."
msgstr "船長は机の中に手を伸ばした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "I might have another, if you care for some more?"
msgstr "もし君がもっと欲しいなら、もう一つあるかもしれないが？"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt a warm glow on her face, the pleasant buzzing of the room, her dulled senses."
msgstr "サラは顔に温かな熱気を感じ、部屋が心地よく揺れ、感覚が鈍くなっていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She was quite way to tipsy, and knew a bottle more would probably tip her over the edge."
msgstr "彼女はかなり酔っ払っており、もう一本飲めば限界を越えてしまうだろうと分かっていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Perhaps it would be wiser to end the night early."
msgstr "おそらく、今夜は早めに切り上げた方が賢明だろう。"

msgctxt "menu"
msgid "Keep Drinking"
msgstr "飲み続ける"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah leaned back and smiled."
msgstr "サラは後ろに寄りかかり、微笑んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "Well, if you happen to have a bottle on hand..."
msgstr "ええ、もし手元に瓶があったなら……"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Captain smiled and pulled it out."
msgstr "キャプテンは微笑んでそれを取り出した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "With a smooth motion, he uncorked it, and the wine continued to flow."
msgstr "滑らかな動きで栓を抜くと、ワインが流れ続けた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As the night grew deeper and they kept talking, Sarah found herself increasingly drawn in."
msgstr "夜が更け、二人が話し続けるうちに、サラは次第に彼に引き込まれていった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The Captain was a more fascinating man than she had met in years."
msgstr "キャプテンは、彼女が長年出会ったどの男性よりも魅力的な人物だった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "As he walked across the cabin, he showed her trinkets from his travels."
msgstr "キャビン内を歩きながら、彼は旅先で集めた小物を彼女に見せた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And for each item, he told her the story of how he had come about it."
msgstr "そして、それぞれの品について、彼はそれがどうやって手に入れたのか、その物語を彼女に語った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "The man appeared to have lived enough adventures for a dozen lifetimes."
msgstr "その男は、まるで十数回分の人生で十分な冒険を経験してきたかのように見えた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She was standing close to him when he was showing her a brightly coloured shell."
msgstr "彼が彼女に色鮮やかな貝殻を見せていると、彼女は彼のそばに立っていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Had it been any other man, she would have kept a greater distance."
msgstr "もし他の男だったら、彼女はもっと距離を置いたであろう。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But perhaps it was the wine, the pleasant conversation, or the man's apparent age."
msgstr "だが、おそらくそれはワインのせいだろうか、心地よい会話のせいだろうか、あるいはその男の見た目の年齢のせいだろうか。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Whichever the reason, it had lulled Sarah into a sense of comforting trust."
msgstr "理由が何であれ、それはサラを心地よい信頼感に浸らせていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He pressed it into her palms."
msgstr "彼はそれを彼女の両手のひらに押し付けた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Hold it, if you like."
msgstr "気に入ったら、持っていていい。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah ran her fingers across the object, feeling its texture."
msgstr "サラは指をその物体の上で滑らせ、その質感を感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "It's...beautiful..."
msgstr "…美しい…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She saw him turning his eyes to her."
msgstr "彼女は彼が自分の方へ視線を向けるのを見た。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "As are you."
msgstr "君も同じだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She felt his hand, grazing her cheek, putting her hair behind her ear."
msgstr "彼女は彼の手に触れた。その手が彼女の頬を撫で、髪を耳の後ろに流した。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Even amidsts her drowzy state, Sarah understood his sudden intention."
msgstr "眠気に襲われていたにもかかわらず、サラは彼の突然の意図を察していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She looked up and met his eyes."
msgstr "彼女は顔を上げ、彼の目と合った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Strong, cold grey."
msgstr "強く、冷たい灰色。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She felt herself suddenly nervous."
msgstr "彼女は突然緊張したのを感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "You...you've lived such an exciting life...all these adventures...stories..."
msgstr "あなた…あなたは本当に刺激的な人生を送ってきたのね…数々の冒険や物語も…"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "I'm happy you think I'm interesting."
msgstr "君が僕を面白いと思ってくれるのは嬉しいよ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His hand still lingered on the side of her face."
msgstr "彼の手は、まだ彼女の顔の横に留まっていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "I think you're very interesting as well."
msgstr "君もとても面白いと思うよ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "His eyes never left hers."
msgstr "彼の視線は、彼女の目から決して離れなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I...I do...but I think that..."
msgstr "わ…わかってる…でも、そう思うの…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah stumbled over her own words."
msgstr "サラは自分の言葉に詰まってしまった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He smiled some more."
msgstr "彼はさらに微笑んだ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "What is it?"
msgstr "何なんだ？"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I just thought we were...having fun..."
msgstr "ただ、私たちが…楽しんでいるだけだと思ってたの…"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I didn't know that you..."
msgstr "あなたが…そんなことをしていたなんて、知らなかったわ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "何だって？"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "That I was attracted to you?"
msgstr "私が君に惹かれていたと？"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Come now, don't insult either of us by pretending not to know how you look."
msgstr "おいおい、自分の見た目を知らないふりをして、お互いを侮辱するような真似はするなよ。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt her face flush at his compliment."
msgstr "サラは彼の称賛に顔を赤らめた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "No...but I..."
msgstr "いいえ…でも、私は…"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah didn't know what to say, so he simply said the truth."
msgstr "サラは何も言えなかった。だから彼は、ただ真実を告げた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Sarah"
msgid "I just didn't think that you...at your age..."
msgstr "ただ、あなたのこと…その年齢で…まだ男だなんて、思ってもみなかったの。"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "What? You think a man my age stops being a man?"
msgstr "何？俺の歳で男でなくなると思うのか？"

msgctxt "speaker:Captain"
msgid "Because I can assure you, everything still works."
msgstr "なぜなら、断言できるが、すべてまだちゃんと機能しているからな。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He grabbed her wrist and forced it down between his legs."
msgstr "彼は彼女の手首を掴み、無理やり自分の股間に押し付けた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt the tip of her fingers felt his erection through his pants."
msgstr "サラは指先で彼のズボン越しの勃起を感じた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He wasn't lying."
msgstr "彼は嘘をついていなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A flush of heat build in her chest."
msgstr "熱が彼女の胸にこみ上げてきた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She hadn't thought of the man like this all night."
msgstr "彼女は一晩中、この男性をこのように考えたことはなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Now she couldn't deny that he was indeed a man, no matter his age."
msgstr "今や彼女は、彼の年齢がどうであれ、彼が確かに男であるという事実を否定することはできなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He pressed his lips up against hers, kissing her suddenly."
msgstr "彼は彼女の唇に自分の唇を押し当て、突然キスをした。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Sarah felt a rush of sensations, drowning out her thoughts."
msgstr "サラは感覚の奔流を感じ、思考が押し流されていった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Before she realized it, she was kissing him back, feverishly."
msgstr "気づく間もなく、彼女は熱心に彼にキスを返していた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Their hands rushed across one another's body, grasping and groping over their clothes."
msgstr "彼らの手は互いの体の上を駆け巡り、服の上から掴み、探り合った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "A faint distant voice in her head tried to speak reason."
msgstr "頭の中で、かすかな遠い声が理性を呼びかけていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "What was she doing with a man old enough to be her father, no, older still."
msgstr "彼女が父親と同じくらいの年齢、いやそれ以上にもなる男性とキスをしているなんて、一体何をしているのだろうか。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "But the reasoned thought was faint compared to the building torrent of desire and lust."
msgstr "しかし、理性の声は、高まり続ける欲望と情欲の奔流の前ではかすかなものに過ぎなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "And soon that voice went quiet entirely."
msgstr "そして間もなく、その声は完全に静まり返った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Pulling on one another's clothes, the two of them undressed one another, throwing their clothes to the ground without care."
msgstr "互いの服を脱がし合いながら、二人は互いの体を解き放ち、服を無造作に床へと放り投げた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "In the sudden frenzy, Sarah nearly tripped over her own panties as they slid to the floor."
msgstr "突然の興奮の中、サラは床に滑り落ちた自分のパンティに足を引っかけて転びそうになった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She sat on the edge of his desk, now entirely naked, as he likewise threw off the last of his clothes."
msgstr "彼女は彼の机の端に座り、今や完全に裸になっていた。彼もまた最後の服を脱ぎ捨てていた。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "Drowzily, her eyes roamed across his body."
msgstr "彼女は眠気に襲われながら、彼の体中を視線で探った。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "She could not deny his age, but neither could he deny the burning desire that had taken hold of her."
msgstr "彼女は彼の年齢を否定できなかったが、彼もまた彼女を捉えた燃えるような欲望を否定することはできなかった。"

msgctxt "speaker:Narrator"
msgid "He stood between her legs, his cock hard and erect."
msgstr "彼は彼女の両脚の間に立ち、硬く勃起したペニスを構えていた。"

